4:["$","article",null,{"className":"rn-card w-full max-w-[46rem] min-w-0 px-5 py-8 sm:px-10 sm:py-10 lg:px-14 lg:py-12","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"rn-doc rn-links measure break-words [&>h2:first-child]:mt-0 [&>h2:first-child]:border-t-0 [&>h2:first-child]:pt-0","children":[["$","h2",".0",{"children":"What is tested automatically","id":"what-is-tested-automatically"}],["$","ul",".1",{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"axe-core"}]," runs against the main page templates (the home page, search, a listing, the sell to a dealership page, the Rynet Digital pages and the two-factor page) at a desktop size, and all of them except the two-factor page at a phone size too. Zero violations is the pass mark, and a single one fails the build."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Colour contrast"}]," is computed from the design tokens rather than eyeballed. The text and control colour pairs in both themes are checked against the WCAG threshold that applies to each, and a change that breaks one fails the build."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Layout from 320 to 1920 pixels wide"}],", checking that nothing forces the page to scroll sideways."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Both colour themes"}],", including with JavaScript switched off, and pages with reduced motion requested."]}]]}],["$","h2",".2",{"children":"Built in from the start","id":"built-in-from-the-start"}],["$","ul",".3",{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Semantic HTML first. ARIA only where the HTML genuinely falls short."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Everything operable by keyboard, with one focus ring that stays visible on light and dark grounds."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"A skip link, so you are not tabbing through the whole header on every page."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Every form field has a visible label that stays put. Placeholders are never used as labels, because they vanish the moment you start typing."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Form errors are tied to their field and say what to do about it."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Controls are at least 24 by 24 pixels, and the main actions at least 44 pixels tall."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Reduced motion is honoured, and reduced does not mean broken: nothing disappears and no state becomes unreachable."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Status is never carried by colour alone. Every coloured state has words or an icon."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"The search filters work with JavaScript switched off."}]]}],["$","h2",".4",{"children":"What is not done yet","id":"what-is-not-done-yet"}],["$","p",".5",{"children":"Being straight about this is the point of the page. As at the date above:"}],["$","ul",".6",{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"No manual screen reader testing has been carried out."}]," Automated checks catch roughly a third of accessibility problems. A full NVDA and VoiceOver pass over search, listings, enquiry, selling and the dealership pages has not happened."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Photograph descriptions have not been tested with the people who rely on them."}]," ","Listing photographs carry a description built from the vehicle details, which a dealership can replace per photograph."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Some pages are not covered by the automated checks above"}],", including the dealership directory, the dealership pages and the legal pages."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"The admin screens"}]," that dealerships and Rynet staff sign in to have not been assessed."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":"There is no formal WCAG-EM conformance report. When there is, it will be published here with its date and scope."}]]}],"$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15"]}]}]
